# Shared capture settings — sourced by every view tape so the seven images stay
# one consistent set. Edit here, then re-render ALL of them; never edit a single
# tape's geometry.
#
# FontSize must keep the widest status bar (the Attributes tab adds
# "s sort   f filter") unclipped; check the trailing "<theme> · <interval>"
# is visible in attributes.png when changing it.
# Framerate 5 only thins the throwaway GIF — Screenshot quality is unaffected.
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 5
